ng their sockets, a terrible nausea overwhelmed me, and eventually I fainted.\n\nI cannot say how long I stayed unconscious. It must have been a considerable time, because when I began to regain awareness I saw the day breaking. The balloon was at an enormous height over a vast ocean, and there was no land in sight anywhere on the horizon."
